<title>NETHERLANDS: COMVIK FACILITY OVERSUBSCRIBED - ABN AMRO.</title>
<headline>COMVIK FACILITY OVERSUBSCRIBED - ABN AMRO.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A $70 million syndicated credit facility for Comvik International Vietnam AB, a division of Luxembourg-based Millicom International Cellular SA , has been oversubscribed, arranger ABN AMRO said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said the facility, for the purchase of telecoms equipment from Ericsson , would enable Comvik to develop its GSM mobile telephony activities in southern Vietnam.</p>
<p>Dutch bank ABN AMRO Bank was also the underwriter, facility agent and security agent of the facility.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
